   "key": "next_step",
   "title": "Possible next steps",
   "text": "A good first step is to reach out to the Canadian Society for Mucopolysaccharide & Related Diseases Inc, a family support group that the atlas links directly to MPS IIIC [Ed13b8bf, E82a04b9]. Another step is to contact AIMPS ETS in Italy, another family support group that the atlas links directly to MPS IIIC [E30302cc]. A third step is to reach out to the Cure Sanfilippo Foundation in the United States, which the atlas also links directly to MPS IIIC [E8303439]. It may help to ask the child's care team about these groups and how they might offer support or information [E8303439].",
